{"unit_id": "tag:02L7:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>是一个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）。假设每个<MATH_0003>都是拟仿射（quasi-affine）的。这意味着每个<MATH_0004>都是拟紧（quasi-compact）且分离（separated）的。由引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>，这意味着<MATH_0005>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且分离（separated）的。考虑<MATH_0006>代数（algebras）的层（sheaf）<MATH_0007>。由《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0003>，它是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0008>代数（algebra）。考虑典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0009>，见《构造（Constructions）》引理<REF_0004>。由平坦（flat）基变换（base change）（例如见《概形上同调（Cohomology of Schemes）》引理<REF_0005>），有<MATH_0010>，其中<MATH_0011>是给定的平坦（flat）映射（maps）。因此，基变换（base change）<MATH_0012>，即<MATH_0013>沿<MATH_0014>所得者，是《构造（Constructions）》引理<REF_0006>中的典范态射（canonical morphism），对应于态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>。由假设及《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0007>，所有这些态射（morphisms）<MATH_0016>都是拟紧开（quasi-compact open）浸入（immersions）。所以，由引理<REF_0008>和<REF_0009>可知<MATH_0017>是拟紧开（quasi-compact open）浸入（immersion）。因此，再次由《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0010>可得<MATH_0018>是拟仿射（quasi-affine）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖"}, {"source_term": "quasi-affine", "target_term": "拟仿射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology of Schemes", "target_term": "概形上同调"}, {"source_te